{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/minchah_maariv/amidah/uvekhen_ten_kavod"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n26.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/uvekhen_ten_kavod"}}
{"text":"And therefore grant honour, O Lord, to Thy people, fame to those who fear Thee and praise to those who seek Thee and confidence to those who wait for Thee, joy to Thy"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n28.jpg","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/uvekhen_ten_kavod"}}
{"text":"land, happiness to Thy city and a rise of fortune to David Thy servant and an array of light to the son of Jesse Thine anointed speedily and in our days."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
